{
  "note": [
    "Mech Corridor North's fabric (DR-106, the mech wing), cut from the one Kalamontee layout in scripts/fabric-kalamontee.mjs -- regenerate from there, do not hand-edit. 4.4 x 3.4 x 12 as the Junction's glimpse placed it, the eye at the middle; the Mech Corridor is the same hall (compone.zil 1289-1317, the same text) and takes this shell.",
    "The game: \"Entrances to rooms lie to the east and west from this north-south hall\" (compone.zil 1293). North, the 3.4 x 2.9 mouth onto the Corridor Junction and the one corridor line on north through the admin wing to the Transportation Supply's dark portal, 60 m out; south, the same mouth onto the Mech Corridor, and down the line Mech Corridor South and, 33.7 m out, the Machine Shop's dispenser. East, 1 m south of the eye, Storage East's 1.2 x 2.25 doorway: the shelf unit on its east wall. West, 2 m north of the eye, the Physical Plant's 2.4 x 2.8 north-east exit: its north wall and the catwalk over the doorway's line.",
    "No painted states: no door, and the ladder across the rift, 48 m up the line, is a sliver left out as the Junction leaves it out (no LADDER-FLAG switch)."
